				Every new Tamer chooses a starter Beast. The starter is your first
				partner — fully owned, no contract required, and ready to fight.
			</p>

			<HelpScreenshot ShotCaption="Starter selection screen" />

			<span class="help-section-title">What to look for</span>
			<div class="help-keypoints">
