				</div>
				<div class="help-keypoint">
					<iconify icon="lucide:sparkles" Size=@(16) Color="#a78bfa" />
					<span><strong>SpA</strong> — special attack. Used by elemental and magic moves.</span>
				</div>
				<div class="help-keypoint">
					<iconify icon="lucide:shield-check" Size=@(16) Color="#60a5fa" />
