			</p>

			<span class="help-section-title">The Power formula</span>
			<div class="help-callout">
				<span class="help-callout-eyebrow">Weighted sum</span>
				<span class="help-callout-formula">Power = (HP ÷ 10) + ATK + DEF + SpA + SpD + (SPD ÷ 2) + (Level × 5)</span>
				<span class="help-callout-text">HP is divided by 10 because it scales much higher than the others. Speed is halved so glass cannons don't dominate the score.</span>
			</div>

			<span class="help-section-title">What Power tells you</span>
			<div class="help-keypoints">
				<div class="help-keypoint">
