					<span><strong>Fire vs Nature</strong> — 2.0× super effective. The clearest one-shot setup in the game.</span>
				</div>
				<div class="help-keypoint">
					<iconify icon="lucide:droplet" Size=@(16) Color="#3b82f6" />
					<span><strong>Water vs Fire</strong> — 2.0×. Bring a Water beast to almost any Fire boss fight.</span>
				</div>
				<div class="help-keypoint">
					<iconify icon="lucide:zap" Size=@(16) Color="#fbbf24" />
					<span><strong>Electric vs Water</strong> — 2.0×. Pairs with a Water sweeper to cover the elements your team is weak to.</span>
				</div>
				<div class="help-keypoint">
					<iconify icon="lucide:wind" Size=@(16) Color="#86efac" />
					<span><strong>Earth vs Electric</strong> — 2.0×. Earth is the only type that solidly walls Electric.</span>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="help-quicktip">
				<iconify icon="lucide:lightbulb" Size=@(14) Color="#fbbf24" />
				<span>The Full Chart subtab has every matchup laid out in a grid. Battle tooltips show the live multiplier against the current target — chart for team planning, tooltips for in-the-moment.</span>
			</div>
