	private RenderFragment RenderCombatStatus() => __builder =>
	{
		<div class="help-page">
			<HelpHero HeroIcon="lucide:flame" HeroTitle="Status Effects" HeroSubtitle="Conditions that stick after the hit" />

			<p class="help-lead">
				Status effects are persistent conditions on a Beast. Some chip damage, some
				skip turns, some disable abilities. Most last until the Beast is healed,
				switched out, or the battle ends.
			</p>

			<span class="help-section-title">The main conditions</span>
			<div class="help-keypoints">
				<div class="help-keypoint">
					<iconify icon="lucide:flame" Size=@(16) Color="#ef4444" />
					<span><strong>Burn</strong> — ticks 1/15 of MaxHP damage every turn AND halves Physical damage dealt. Persists until healed. Brutal on ATK-heavy beasts.</span>
				</div>
				<div class="help-keypoint">
					<iconify icon="lucide:snowflake" Size=@(16) Color="#7dd3fc" />
					<span><strong>Freeze</strong> — the Beast skips its turn entirely until it thaws. Persists until healed. Rare but devastating when it lands.</span>
				</div>
				<div class="help-keypoint">
					<iconify icon="lucide:zap-off" Size=@(16) Color="#fbbf24" />
					<span><strong>Paralyze</strong> — speed is gutted, and the Beast occasionally fails to act. Persists until healed. Game-changing on a fast attacker.</span>
				</div>
				<div class="help-keypoint">
					<iconify icon="lucide:droplet" Size=@(16) Color="#a855f7" />
					<span><strong>Poison</strong> — ticks 1/10 of MaxHP damage every turn. Persists until healed. Even a single poison on a boss is meaningful over a long fight.</span>
				</div>
				<div class="help-keypoint">
					<iconify icon="lucide:moon" Size=@(16) Color="#60a5fa" />
					<span><strong>Sleep</strong> — skips turns. Wears off on its own after a few rounds; can be hit-broken in some matchups.</span>
				</div>
				<div class="help-keypoint">
					<iconify icon="lucide:help-circle" Size=@(16) Color="#f472b6" />
					<span><strong>Confuse</strong> — the Beast may attack itself instead of the target. Wears off after a few turns.</span>
				</div>
			</div>

			<span class="help-section-title">Stat stages</span>
			<div class="help-callout">
				<span class="help-callout-eyebrow">Buff/debuff steps</span>
				<span class="help-callout-text">Status moves can shift a stat up or down in stages (−6 to +6). Each stage roughly multiplies that stat by another increment — three stages of +ATK is the difference between chip and one-shot.</span>
