	private RenderFragment RenderContracts() => __builder =>
	{
		<div class="content-section">
			<span class="page-title">Contracts</span>
			<p class="intro-text">
				After defeating wild beasts in expeditions, you can recruit them to your team
				using Contract Ink. Choose your negotiation approach wisely!
			</p>

			<div class="section">
				<h2>How Contracts Work</h2>
				<ol class="numbered-list">
					<li>Defeat a wild beast in an expedition</li>
					<li>After the battle, choose to <strong>negotiate a contract</strong></li>
					<li>Pick from <strong>4 negotiation options</strong>with different costs and chances</li>
					<li>If successful, the beast joins your team permanently!</li>
				</ol>
			</div>

			<div class="section">
				<h2>Negotiation Options</h2>
				<p>Each recruitment gives you 4 different approaches with different base rates:</p>
				<div class="comparison-box">
					<div class="compare-item">
						<h3>🎁 Generous Offer</h3>
						<ul>
							<li><strong>3 🖋️</strong> ink cost</li>
							<li><strong>70%</strong> base rate (up to 95%)</li>
							<li>Harder contract demands</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<div class="compare-item">
						<h3>⚖️ Fair Terms</h3>
						<ul>
							<li><strong>2 🖋️</strong> ink cost</li>
							<li><strong>50%</strong> base rate (up to 85%)</li>
							<li>Normal contract demands</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<div class="compare-item">
						<h3>📋 Strict Terms</h3>
						<ul>
							<li><strong>1 🖋️</strong> ink cost</li>
							<li><strong>30%</strong> base rate (up to 65%)</li>
							<li>Lighter contract demands</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<div class="compare-item">
						<h3>🪙 Golden Handshake</h3>
						<ul>
							<li><strong>2 🖋️ + Gold</strong> cost</li>
							<li><strong>60%</strong> base + 15% bonus (up to 90%)</li>
							<li>Gold cost scales with rarity and level</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="section">
				<h2>How Success Chance Is Calculated</h2>
				<p>Your final success chance is calculated using this formula:</p>
				<div class="formula-box">
					<span class="formula">Final % = Base Rate × HP Modifier × Rarity Modifier × (1 + Skill Bonuses)</span>
				</div>
				<p>Each modifier affects your chances:</p>
			</div>

			<div class="section">
				<h2>HP Modifier (Up to +100%)</h2>
				<p>Lower HP makes beasts easier to convince:</p>
				<ul class="detail-list">
					<li><strong>100% HP:</strong> 0.5x modifier (half effectiveness)</li>
					<li><strong>50% HP:</strong> 0.75x modifier</li>
					<li><strong>25% HP:</strong> 0.875x modifier</li>
					<li><strong>1% HP:</strong> ~1.0x modifier (full effectiveness)</li>
				</ul>
				<p class="note">Weaken beasts in battle for better contract rates!</p>
			</div>

